ReadCSV breaks on io.EOF, skips rows on errors.Is(err, csv.ErrFieldCount) and wraps
the rest in *RowError (custom Unwrap). Expected: sentinel records.ErrNoRows
(unwrapped); csv.ErrBareQuote / csv.ErrQuote under *csv.ParseError.Unwrap ->
*RowError.Unwrap; csv.errInvalidDelim under *RowError.Unwrap; the strconv.Atoi set
under *NumError.Unwrap -> *RowError.Unwrap. csv.ErrFieldCount and io.EOF must NOT
appear. bufio's field load may show as Unresolved(memory), possibly handled.
-- args --
records/records.go:@readcsv
